{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your loyal dog has been taken by a monstrous evil, and it's time to make him pay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683660/extras/samurai-gif-2-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1748047766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Rogue Inferno</strong></i> is a grid-based roguelike deckbuilder where strategy and positioning are the keys to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this Demo, you'll step into the role of the Samurai and master a unique 3-stance combat system. Slash your way through relentless enemy waves in the heart of a sun-scorched desert. The first glimpse of a brutal journey ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deck-Building Meets Grid-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft a deck that suits your playstyle! Position yourself strategically on the grid and draw, play, and manage cards each turn to attack, defend, or unleash powerful combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683660/extras/mockup-1.png?t=1748047766\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Find Unique Monsters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face a wide array of enemies, each with unique behaviors and strategies. From scorpions that exhaust you to explosive enemies and mutant variants, every encounter is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683660/extras/all-enemies-idle.gif?t=1748047766\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And Much More!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3683660?t=1748047766","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3683660/6557978247723239acf7ad7200012edf47f68ac2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748047766","capsule_im